---
// One HTTP request, end to end: the stages your request crosses before your
// Python code runs, and the response path back. Bilingual labels switch with
// the site language (data-lang-en / data-lang-vi tspans).
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
---
<figure class="blcd">
  <div class="blcd-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A request flowing through DNS, TCP, TLS, HTTP and ASGI stages down to your Python code, then the response returning.">
      {/* top row: the request */}
      <text x="16" y="26" class="blcd-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Before your code runs — one GET /cases/42</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Trước khi code của bạn chạy — một GET /cases/42</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="14" y="42" width="120" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="74" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b">URL</text>
      <text x="74" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">https://clue.api</text>
      <text x="74" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">/cases/42</text>

      <rect x="158" y="42" width="120" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="218" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b">DNS</text>
      <text x="218" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>name → IP</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tên → địa chỉ IP</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="218" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">172.66.46.235</text>

      <rect x="302" y="42" width="120" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="362" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b">TCP</text>
      <text x="362" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3-way handshake</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bắt tay 3 bước</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="362" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">:443</text>

      <rect x="446" y="42" width="120" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="506" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b">TLS</text>
      <text x="506" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>cert + keys</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>chứng chỉ + khoá</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="506" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">TLS 1.3</text>

      <rect x="590" y="42" width="120" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="650" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b">HTTP</text>
      <text x="650" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">GET / HTTP/2</text>
      <text x="650" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>headers in, bytes out</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>header vào, byte ra</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="734" y="42" width="152" height="74" rx="8" class="blcd-box is-red" />
      <text x="810" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>uvicorn → ASGI</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>uvicorn → ASGI</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="810" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>your callable, at last</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>callable của bạn, cuối cùng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="810" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="blcd-m">scope · receive · send</text>

      <g class="blcd-arrow">
        <line x1="134" y1="79" x2="154" y2="79" /><polygon points="154,75 162,79 154,83" />
        <line x1="278" y1="79" x2="298" y2="79" /><polygon points="298,75 306,79 298,83" />
        <line x1="422" y1="79" x2="442" y2="79" /><polygon points="442,75 450,79 442,83" />
        <line x1="566" y1="79" x2="586" y2="79" /><polygon points="586,75 594,79 586,83" />
        <line x1="710" y1="79" x2="730" y2="79" /><polygon points="730,75 738,79 730,83" />
      </g>

      {/* bottom row: response back */}
      <text x="16" y="156" class="blcd-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. The answer, back up the same pipe</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Câu trả lời, đi ngược lại đúng con ống đó</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="14" y="172" width="872" height="52" rx="8" class="blcd-box" />
      <text x="30" y="192" class="blcd-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>200 OK — content-type: application/json — 541 bytes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>200 OK — content-type: application/json — 541 byte</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="30" y="210" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>one response, same sockets: your code → ASGI → uvicorn → TLS → TCP → browser</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>một câu trả lời, vẫn con socket đó: code bạn → ASGI → uvicorn → TLS → TCP → browser</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* what you own */}
      <text x="16" y="254" class="blcd-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>You own the red box. Every other stage can add latency or lose the request — and none of them run your code.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn chỉ sở hữu ô đỏ. Mọi ô còn lại đều có thể làm chậm hoặc làm mất request — và không ô nào chạy code của bạn.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The life of one request: six stations before your first line of Python, one pipe back for the answer.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cuộc đời một request: sáu trạm trước dòng Python đầu tiên, và một con ống quay lại cho câu trả lời.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .blcd { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .blcd-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .blcd svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .blcd text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .blcd-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .blcd-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .blcd-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .blcd-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .blcd-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .blcd-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .blcd-arrow line { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .blcd-arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .blcd figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
